    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Using property of definite integration&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Using&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi></mstyle></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi></mstyle></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>x</mi></mstyle></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>On adding the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2